      "refersTo": "collection",
      "description": "Semantic surface table with compact headers, quiet dividers, and panel hover.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-collection\"><table class=\"ds-table\"><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\">Quiz</th><th scope=\"col\">Status</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Request cancellation</td><td>In progress</td></tr><tr><td>Configuration merge</td><td>Completed</td></tr></tbody></table></div>",
